[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 663.03, "timestamp": "00:11:03", "text": "帶有自訂程式碼的自訂前端。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 666.71, "timestamp": "00:11:06", "text": "它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 669.11, "timestamp": "00:11:09", "text": "能讓你連結任何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 671.91, "timestamp": "00:11:11", "text": "你想連結的東西。 CMS"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 677.971, "timestamp": "00:11:17", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "wow"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 689.43, "timestamp": "00:11:29", "text": "允許您連接到您擁有的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 691.35, "timestamp": "00:11:31", "text": "任何 CMS，包括任何人的任何系統。他們現在開始在很多東西裡加入動畫之類的元素。我正在等待他們的電子商務系統整合完成。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 699.269, "timestamp": "00:11:39", "text": "所以，在電子商務方面，他們會添加 Shopify 以及所有其他電子商務平台，對吧？  他們將允許使用 Web Studio 的用戶連接到他們選擇的任何電子商務平台。  所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 701.43, "timestamp": "00:11:41", "text": "它不僅限於 Shopify。  你可以像使用內容管理系統（CMS）一樣做任何事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 704.949, "timestamp": "00:11:44", "text": "。呃，像我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 713.99, "timestamp": "00:11:53", "text": "用 Notion，可以用 Strappy，可以用 WordPress，任何我想用的軟體都可以。"}]